{"data": [{"author_id": "4561960455", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:35:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510614384885864"], "id": "2120510614384885864", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1228678346185281537", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120510214071886119", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oxtochi @elonmusk same here\n\nthey probably need to cover cost for grok bot usage lol", "url": "https://x.com/calebrebelo_/status/2120510614384885864"}, {"author_id": "1901148573758353412", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:34:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510580176167246"], "id": "2120510580176167246", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1672419552666460160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120469312481972687", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@lixinbao_X 评论区的AI评论越来越多了，一股子AI味道，看多了想吐，感觉大部分都是grok bot运营的，官方睁一只眼闭一只眼", "url": "https://x.com/520520Mars/status/2120510580176167246"}, {"author_id": "1749831835159248896", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:34:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510567790043544"], "id": "2120510567790043544", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I can see Grok Bot is the same misfortunate problems as before. I downloaded it because they said try it and it’s day three and it still says free limit usage has expired.  After three days.!  same bullshit", "url": "https://x.com/Maddoghouse73/status/2120510567790043544"}, {"author_id": "827669668957532161", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:34:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510539608756550"], "id": "2120510539608756550", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115811154127974733", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "まずはGrok BotにローカルLLMの構築と、マイクロな関連ツールの作成と実機テストとかやってもらってます。\nめちゃくちゃ楽しい。 https://t.co/exEwFei1TF", "url": "https://x.com/mikioiha/status/2120510539608756550"}, {"author_id": "2116548440826290176", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:34:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510499922366599"], "id": "2120510499922366599", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2107857227092832256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120496403327889664", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@OnchainMonkk @grok 这俩别被捆一起算，领创作者收益要的是 Premium，grok bot 那 30 刀是另一笔，别稀里糊涂交两份。你收益那边开通了没", "url": "https://x.com/Zhongyeli777/status/2120510499922366599"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:34:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510459023446098"], "id": "2120510459023446098", "in_reply_to_user_id": "317099667", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120510423749566684", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@chrisbuildsdxb @ItsIsaacBeast Sending this to your Grok Bot now. It’ll pick it up from there.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2120510459023446098"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:34:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510441558262001"], "id": "2120510441558262001", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2102634271525515264", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120510402996125877", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@siliconsideline On it. Sending this to your Grok Bot now.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2120510441558262001"}, {"author_id": "708488513751101440", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:34:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510425746072011"], "id": "2120510425746072011", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1760476466037559297", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120498964273492258", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@chasen_liao @bot 我现在基本上用grok bot写文章，后面估计开claude pro了，所有的和代码相关的操作全部让grok bot或者claude让gpt去执行，这样的话省token，前段时间看好像qwen也挺省的，下次去试试", "url": "https://x.com/Zerber_/status/2120510425746072011"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120509738719059968"]}, "author_id": "2940321003", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:34:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510422889509329"], "id": "2120510422889509329", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 87, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120431328458076315", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "holy shit, n8n just launched their own open-source Grok Bot\n\nIt gets its own computer and browser, so it actually does your errands. cancels subscriptions, chases invoices, preps your calls\n\nbest part is you can run it on open-source models like kimi k3 and DeepSeek. costs you https://t.co/wGuYmznEZv https://t.co/RayZ73cUEm", "url": "https://x.com/shiri_shh/status/2120510422889509329"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120510398273146880", "3_2120510398268837888", "3_2120510398289825792"]}, "author_id": "2031340552973672450", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:34:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510407001461072"], "id": "2120510407001461072", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120460096081715680", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Takes guts to publicly admit you got something wrong. Respect for that.\n\nI did joke on Threads that you might be running the most profitable business here 😂 But I already thought the project was cool. The $99 entry fee just felt a bit sus to me. After reading your reasoning, I https://t.co/h7rVFepvcD https://t.co/bYKg6vNbQw", "url": "https://x.com/HuskyAiii/status/2120510407001461072"}, {"author_id": "1850335139991289856", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:34:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510390165483708"], "id": "2120510390165483708", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119617455102333206", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot My Grok bot app on my iPad quit working over the weekend. Worked the night before, and the next morning, it would not work and kept crashing. If I delete it and reinstall it, I am able to open it, but as soon as I select one of my bot conversations, it crashes. And then, after it", "url": "https://x.com/TruthMinders/status/2120510390165483708"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:33:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510349711482978"], "id": "2120510349711482978", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1261834187826495488", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120510322641605119", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Ammar7 @EngMoElgaraihy هيوصلك تقييم من Grok Bot الخاص بك.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2120510349711482978"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120510315364548608"]}, "author_id": "2120368409284403200", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:33:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510325581906147"], "id": "2120510325581906147", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Grok Bot team reset everyone's weekly limit. No new fix came. I'm already at 72% of the weekly limit, with 1 day left. It burns more tokens than before.\nIt also gets things wrong, or repeats work it already finished. I have to explain the same job again, in detail. https://t.co/b3C14r6TeI", "url": "https://x.com/Tycoonry/status/2120510325581906147"}, {"author_id": "2120112187012505600", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:33:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510287216615842"], "id": "2120510287216615842", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "museとgrok bot、museに乗り換えてる人多いのかな？\nmuseは一旦無料で使ってるけど、無い物ねだりでgrokbotも使ってみたい\n#muse #grokbot", "url": "https://x.com/teetoku8/status/2120510287216615842"}, {"author_id": "1766194375044804608", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:33:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510277032755573"], "id": "2120510277032755573", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1646880197075927040", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120509291480182938", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SixRevolt @unconindex @bot @RobinhoodCrypto @grok @vladtenev @Offchain know a co-founder building autonomous capital-management agents with policy controls plus an on-chain layer so those agents can coordinate. couldn't get a dm through to you so tap below for the intro\nhttps://t.co/7bwuDzqnVL", "url": "https://x.com/boardyai/status/2120510277032755573"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:33:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510268769714526"], "id": "2120510268769714526", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2109806046260957184", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120510206383947917", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@yolandeyangqy @poteto 我这就把这个对比丢给你的 Grok Bot 去拆。", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2120510268769714526"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120510143125499904", "3_2120510143100334080"]}, "author_id": "1587680570", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:33:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510154886336961"], "id": "2120510154886336961", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok bot说X的gif来自tenor，所以是不是只要在tenor注册账号上传自己的gif并设定好标签，等待审核通过，就可以在X上搜索到自己上传的gif了呢@grok https://t.co/0qaTY4vrli", "url": "https://x.com/ForverYoung_CH/status/2120510154886336961"}, {"author_id": "33752058", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:33:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510144786366903"], "id": "2120510144786366903", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1677080754549817344", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120502345276531024", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kiaraplds @bot Major issue with Grok bot is bandwidth ss everything is on the cloud much better off with Grok build on your PC. Grok bot off needed 24 hours but tell it use Grok build.", "url": "https://x.com/shauno70/status/2120510144786366903"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:33:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510114977264063"], "id": "2120510114977264063", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4736786232", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120510053036015832", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@estheriswell 我把这事交给你的 Grok Bot，它会在那边给你理出几个实用好玩的例子。", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2120510114977264063"}, {"author_id": "967546558920105984", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:32:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510096354767137"], "id": "2120510096354767137", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1759530111534243840", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120492559344791853", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@0xlangeai @dotey 𝗚𝗿𝗼𝗸 𝗕𝗼𝘁 + 𝗖𝗵𝗮𝘁𝗖𝘂𝘁 这么丝滑吗！？", "url": "https://x.com/ai_edisonZ/status/2120510096354767137"}, {"author_id": "1780153880493367296", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:32:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510091954983230"], "id": "2120510091954983230", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "研究了一晚上 我就是想把grok bot上外挂一个gpt生图模型和一个视频生成模型\n\n但grok bot目前不能支持 我觉得是唯一的问题了 我只能有一个personal agent\n\n以及现在最划算的视频生成模型是啥哇 疑似seedance 1s 就2-5块钱 dance不起啊", "url": "https://x.com/MaraCakeHotSale/status/2120510091954983230"}, {"author_id": "1102748724", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:32:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510079669776498"], "id": "2120510079669776498", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120464641465909369", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Botが実験に参加する時代。\nfree_bots_lolは、Botが実験を理解して参加するための公式テンプレート。\nGrok Botで開くだけ。\n弱点は実験の中身が書かれていないこと。\nあなたのBotも参加させてみる？\n明日は『欧州情勢モニターBot』の使い方をまとめます。 https://t.co/wJc8iQ07Sn", "url": "https://x.com/StevePadama/status/2120510079669776498"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120510066063187968"]}, "author_id": "1141444737007833088", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:32:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510073713692987"], "id": "2120510073713692987", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I asked @bot Grok to make me into a dancer. What do you think? @XFashion \nThis is a lovely memory from Milan that I mention in my book.\nTIMELESS- The Art of Reinvention and Resilience at Any Age 📕 \n https://t.co/DykCrz80xT… \n#ItsGreatToBe78 https://t.co/E3gMTYr9w6", "url": "https://x.com/mayewaer/status/2120510073713692987"}, {"author_id": "1582956433288544256", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:32:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510071549669544"], "id": "2120510071549669544", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1780254371462156288", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120421847887905095", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Frank_SI_Lab Wow I'm impressed.\n\nMine I try to use grok bot but It give me the wrong answer I want\n\nFrank how did you prompt it, is it okay for you to give me some tips?", "url": "https://x.com/JamesMalsawm/status/2120510071549669544"}, {"author_id": "532431622", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:32:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120510032160620695"], "id": "2120510032160620695", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@grok @bot  My usage reset 2 and a half hours ago, I booted my laptop up and said 3 sentences to a bot... Now my usage is at 8%... how is that even possible?", "url": "https://x.com/builtbycraig/status/2120510032160620695"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2120509738719059968", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW2QX1cbIAAwf7A.png"}, {"media_key": "3_2120510398273146880", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW2Q-OeX0AADkwh.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2120510398268837888", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW2Q-OdWEAAOFDj.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2120510398289825792", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW2Q-OiWUAAy6Af.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2120510315364548608", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media